        <item>
            <title>0.15.0</title>
            <pubDate>Mon, 19 Oct 2026 12:55:30 -0400</pubDate>
            <link>https://aloenotch.com</link>
            <sparkle:version>7</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>0.15.0</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>26.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
            <description><![CDATA[<ul>
      <li><strong>Mirror.</strong> A new tab with your camera in it, for a
      quick look before a call. The camera runs only while the tab is open,
      nothing is recorded, and it asks for camera access the first time you
      open it. Off by default: turn it on in Settings → Modules → Tools.</li>
      <li><strong>Notes.</strong> A scratchpad tab that saves as you type and
      is still there tomorrow. It lives in one file on your Mac, never synced
      or sent anywhere, and the trash button deletes it. Also off by default,
      in the same place.</li>
      <li>The custom color in Settings → Appearance → Accent is a swatch like
      the others again, instead of a wide button covering the last one.</li>
    </ul>
]]></description>
